#v(5pt)

+ Attempt *all forty* questions in *forty minutes*, without notes and without a calculator that stores formulae.

+ Work in the order you choose. The questions are independent, so a difficult one can be left for the end.

+ Mark yourself against the key only when the forty minutes have elapsed.

+ Compare this paper's Question Map with the one from Mock 1. A chapter that misses in both papers is the one to revise.

